<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Servidor Web Hardened - Ansible</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 90%;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }
        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #059669;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }
        li {
            padding: 0.75rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .label {
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
        .value {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #f1f5f9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <span class="status-badge">✓ Provisionado con Ansible</span>
        <h1>Estado del Servidor Web</h1>
        <p>Servidor web y hardening base configurados mediante Infraestructura como Código (IaC).</p>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <span class="label">Hostname:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ ansible_facts['hostname'] }}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="label">Sistema Operativo:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ ansible_facts['distribution'] }} {{ ansible_facts['distribution_version'] }}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="label">Dirección IP Primaria:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ ansible_facts['default_ipv4']['address'] | default('N/A') }}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="label">Memoria RAM Total:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ (ansible_facts['memtotal_mb'] / 1024) | round(2) }} GB</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="label">Arquitectura:</span>
                <span class="value">{{ ansible_facts['architecture'] }}</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
